    rdfs:label "Optional Command implementing the guard logic"@en ;
    rdfs:comment """A Command id resolvable in the same plan whose body implements
        the guard. E.g., a budget_gate guard with guardRef pointing to a Command
        that wraps an in-memory counter and the plan's cost_bounded law."""@en ;
